{
 "encounter_id": "00965",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I had a funny turn on Saturday night, chest discomfort after a very big meal, and my wife insisted I come, although I'm sure it's nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm glad she did. Tell me exactly what happened. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "We had a large roast, with a great deal of crackling, and about an hour after, I felt a pressure behind my breastbone. It lasted about twenty minutes, and it's not happened since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So once, only on Saturday. How would you describe it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A burning, a sort of heat, rising up behind the bone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did it spread anywhere?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, not to my arm or my jaw. It stayed where it was."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you get it when you walk, or climb stairs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I walk to the farm gate and back every day. Nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you feel bloated?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, very. Full to the neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness at the time?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little short of breath. Just for the first few minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, years ago. High cholesterol. And gallstones, they found them by accident."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My appendix, in 1990."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a heart attack at fifty-eight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I gave up smoking twenty years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three beers a night, I'm afraid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a farmer. Dairy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what do you eat usually?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very good, except Sundays, when my wife does a roast and a pudding."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Pulse 78, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, weight 96 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pressure all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little up, but nothing to worry about. Let me listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go ahead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, regular rhythm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest is clear."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'm pressing your tummy. Tell me if it's tender.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Slightly, there. Under the ribs, in the middle. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's mild tenderness in the upper middle of your abdomen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's where it was. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any palpitations, any sweating?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I didn't vomit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me repeat. One episode, an hour after a heavy meal, burning, bloating, settled by itself, none since, and nothing on exertion. This sounds most likely like reflux after a heavy meal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not my heart? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's unlikely, but because of your father and your cholesterol, I'd like to arrange an ECG today, and a blood test to check your heart muscle, called a troponin."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Meanwhile, I'd like to start omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day, before breakfast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And an antacid liquid, 10 ml, after meals when needed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it happens again, especially if it comes on when you're walking, go straight to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I understand. ~"
  }
 ],
